{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31309","headline":"赠欧阳秀才 · 刘威","name":"赠欧阳秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐上知音日下身，道光谁不仰清尘。\n偶来水馆逢爲客，旧熟诗名似故人。\n永日空惊沧海阔，何年重见白头新。\n权门要路应行遍，闲伴山夫一夜贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}